 1 day). ROTTEN [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]sorts by interval, then lateness, then newest `created`. The walk [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]tells Bryan by tier where he is, when the commitments are done, and[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]that ROTTEN is stoppable upkeep. No stamps are stripped, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]seed is never run again.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]tiered_morning_review_walk.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/tiered_morning_review_walk.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-3g[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-3g/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Walk contract and Rust evaluator[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]rust-walk[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rust-walk: write the tier/lane-interval contract and conformance vectors[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into docs/freshness.md, add the lane interval keys, tiered queue, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lane-aware intervals, upkeep budget, and schema-3 bob freshness list [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]human/JSON output in Rust.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ledger-tools tiered queue, status bar, and lane marks[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ledger-walk[dim] · [dim][/dim]after rust-walk[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ledger-walk: mirror the tiered evaluator in bob-ledger-tools under [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]freshness namespace v4, update the status bar and review meters, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]give due lane tasks the due freshness mark.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Navigation tier notices, walk anchor, and lane-aware refresh [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]row[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]nav-walk[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ledger-walk[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]nav-walk: give bob-navigation-hotkeys tier-aware jump notices, a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commitments-done boundary notice, a robust walk anchor for advancing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]after stamps and releases, and a refresh row that reads the lane [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]interval from the api.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Config, vault ritual, memory, and live rollout[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after nav-walk[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rollout: add the config block, rewrite the morning ritual in docs and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault, record the decision and glossary memory, install and deploy, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify live, read-only census of stamps, and close ^wip-next-refresh.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-3g","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-3g.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-fc518070d5b9f47a2bbc6317d16bf969","started_at":"2026-10-01T22:30:47.077495+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-3g","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-3g.1","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-3g.2","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-3g.3","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-3g.4","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-3g.land"]}
